WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Just an ordinary person who has never seen the world.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I just said that this guy Lao Chen is too timid.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,060
I heard that all the people living in your neighborhood are ghost leaves.

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,740
Hand over your method of controlling Oniha

5
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,740
It would be better if we spared your life

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,740
You know all the people living in my neighborhood are ghost leaves.

7
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:26,740
How dare you come outside my community to pollute the environment?

8
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:30,730
Aren't you afraid that they will rush out and beat you?

9
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,730
I'm afraid they'll come out and beat you up
